  "claim": "The 2018 Unibet Premier League Darts tournament, organised by the Professional Darts Corporation, is planned to finish at the multi-purpose indoor arena located in the centre of The O2 entertainment complex on the Greenwich Peninsula in south-east London.",
  "evidencia": "Page: 2018 Premier League Darts. Sentence: The 2018 Unibet Premier League Darts will be a darts tournament organised by the Professional Darts Corporation – the fourteenth edition of the tournament.\nPage: 2018 Premier League Darts. Sentence: The event will begin on Thursday 1 February at the 3Arena in Dublin and will end with the Play-Offs at The O2 Arena in London on Thursday 17 May.\nPage: The O2 Arena. Sentence: The O2 Arena (temporarily the sponsor-neutral \"North Greenwich Arena\", during the 2012 Summer Olympics and 2012 Summer Paralympics), is a multi-purpose indoor arena located in the centre of The O2 entertainment complex on the Greenwich Peninsula in south-east London.",
