        "original_id": "39df4abe-6a91-5df5-9fc8-52d582a07fb1",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 2018 Premier League Darts, 2012 Summer Olympics, 2012 Summer Paralympics\n- Organizations: Professional Darts Corporation\n- Places: 3Arena, The O2 Arena, North Greenwich Arena, The O2 entertainment complex, Greenwich Peninsula, Dublin, London\n\nFacts:\n- The O2 Arena was temporarily called North Greenwich Arena during the 2012 Summer Olympics and the 2012 Summer Paralympics.\n- The O2 Arena is a multi-purpose indoor arena in the centre of The O2 entertainment complex on the Greenwich Peninsula in south-east London.\n- The 2018 Unibet Premier League Darts will be organised by the Professional Darts Corporation as the fourteenth edition of the tournament.\n- The 2018 Unibet Premier League Darts will begin on Thursday 1 February at the 3Arena in Dublin.\n- The 2018 Unibet Premier League Darts will end with the Play-Offs at The O2 Arena in London on Thursday 17 May.",
